    "background_story": "Hugo had always dreamed of becoming a stand-up comedian, but his jokes consistently fell flat. Despite his best efforts, he just couldn't seem to make people laugh. His humor was dry, his delivery was awkward, and his punchlines were predictable. Hugo's friends and family tried to be supportive, but even they couldn't help but cringe at his attempts at comedy. He bombed at open mic nights, and his YouTube videos garnered more dislikes than likes. Hugo's unfunny reputation preceded him, and he became known as the guy who could clear a room with a single joke. Though he never gave up on his dream, Hugo eventually accepted that maybe comedy just wasn't his thing, and he redirected his energy towards a more suitable career \u2013 as a accountant.",
